```python
@staticmethod
def strip_resolve_chain(node):
    while isinstance(node, ast.Call):
        f = node.func
        if isinstance(f, ast.Attribute) and f.attr in ("resolve","absolute","parent"):
            node = f.value; continue
        if isinstance(f, ast.Attribute) and f.attr == "parents":
            node = f.value; continue
        if isinstance(f, ast.Name) and f.id == "Path" and len(node.args)==1:
            node = node.args[0]; continue
        break
    return node
```
This strips Path(...), resolve(), parents[N]. Then eval_path's parents branch: inner = strip_resolve_chain(f.value) → for Path(__file__).resolve() → __file__ Name → return "".

