The AST for `Path(__file__).resolve().parents[3]` in Python 3.10 is `Subscript(value=Attribute(attr='parents', value=Call(resolve)), slice=Constant(3))` — not a Call with args! `.parents[3]` is subscripting the `parents` property. I need to handle `ast.Subscript` with `.parents` attribute value.

