Also add module-level `ARGPARSE_VARS` detection function:

```python
def argparse_result_vars(tree):
    names = set()
    for node in ast.walk(tree):
        if isinstance(node, ast.Assign) and isinstance(node.value, ast.Call):
            f = node.value.func
            if isinstance(f, ast.Attribute) and f.attr == "parse_args":
                for t in node.targets:
                    if isinstance(t, ast.Name):
                        names.add(t.id)
    return names
```

Then in analyze_tool: `avars = argparse_result_vars(tree)`, pass to flag_gate_status. Use `args` literal too.

